  m_text: "Background: \r\nTheo once lived in the room where the crime occurred.
    Struggling with bills, spiraling mentally, and possibly using drugs. Known for
    strange late-night arguments with the victim. He was also spotted acting erratically
    the day before the incident.\r\r\r\r"
