  m_text: "Background: \r\nLana is deeply tied to the local party scene and has been
    seen multiple times visiting the victim. She\u2019s rumored to use others\u2019
    homes to store drugs, especially to avoid police detection. Keeps her operations
    tidy\u2014but was she slipping?\r\r\r"
